Depends: ${misc:Depends}, coreutils, x11-xserver-utils, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: libnotify-bin, wlopm
Suggests: libkscreen-bin
Description: turn off displays with one click
 A lightweight desktop launcher for X11 and supported Wayland sessions.
 Uses X11 DPMS, GNOME display power management, KDE KScreen, or wlopm
 for compositors implementing the Wayland output-power-management protocol.
